    "html": "<p>Two long parallel wires X and Y carry equal currents I. The magnetic force exerted per unit length of each wire is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The current in X is halved and the current in Y is doubled. What is the force per unit length of each wire after the change?</p>\n<table><tbody><tr><td></td><td><p>Force per unit length of X</p></td><td><p>Force per unit length of Y</p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"A\"><td><p>A.</p></td><td><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span></p></td><td><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span></p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"B\"><td><p>B.</p></td><td><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{F}{2}\"></span></p></td><td><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2F\"></span></p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"C\"><td><p>C.</p></td><td><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2F\"></span></p></td><td><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{F}{2}\"></span></p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"D\"><td><p>D.</p></td><td><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2F\"></span></p></td><td><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2F\"></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table>"
  },
